### States

[Document every state this component can be in. Minimum required: Default, Hover, Focus, Active, Disabled, Loading (if async), Error (if validating).]

#### Default

[Base appearance. No interaction in progress. Reference variant tables above for values.]

#### Hover

**Visual change:** [what changes from default]
**Behavioral change:** [cursor change, tooltip appearance, etc.]

#### Focus

**Visual change:** [focus ring using color-focus-ring + shadow-focus tokens]
**Behavioral change:** [keyboard interaction enabled]
**Accessibility note:** Focus ring must be visible against all surface colors used behind this component.

#### Active / Pressed

**Visual change:** [pressed state visual]
**Behavioral change:** [interaction being committed]

#### Disabled

**Visual change:** [reduced opacity using color-text-disabled, muted background]
**Behavioral change:** Pointer events disabled. Not keyboard focusable. Not submittable.
**Accessibility:** `aria-disabled="true"`. Do not use HTML `disabled` attribute alone — use `aria-disabled` to ensure screen readers announce the state.

#### Loading

**Visual change:** [spinner replaces label, or skeleton overlay — specify which]
**Behavioral change:** Interaction locked. Cannot be triggered again until state resolves.

#### Error

**Visual change:** [color-semantic-error applied to border or icon]
**Behavioral change:** [what changes about interaction in error state]

