## 5. Interaction Contract

### Mouse

| Event | Response |
|-------|----------|
| Hover | [enter hover state, cursor pointer] |
| Click / Mousedown | [enter active state] |
| Mouseup | [trigger action, return to hover state] |
| Click on disabled | [no response, no cursor change] |

### Keyboard

| Key | Response |
|-----|----------|
| Tab | [focus moves to this element] |
| Shift+Tab | [focus moves away] |
| Enter | [triggers action] |
| Space | [triggers action, if applicable] |
| Escape | [dismisses if in overlay context, else no effect] |

### Touch

| Event | Response |
|-------|----------|
| Tap | [triggers action] |
| Long press | [no special behavior unless specified] |

### Async behavior

[If this component triggers an async operation:]
- On trigger: enters Loading state, locks interaction
- On success: [transitions to success state or returns to default]
- On error: [transitions to error state, unlocks interaction for retry]
- On timeout (>Ns): [shows error state with retry option]

