## 8. Acceptance Criteria

[Testable criteria. Every item must be verifiable by a QA engineer or automated test. No subjective criteria.]

- [ ] [Variant 1] renders with correct background, text, and border tokens in Default state
- [ ] [Variant 2] renders with correct tokens in Default state
- [ ] All variants: Hover state applies correct background token change
- [ ] All variants: Focus state shows focus ring using color-focus-ring token
- [ ] All variants: Active state applies pressed visual change
- [ ] All variants: Disabled state — pointer events blocked, aria-disabled="true" present
- [ ] All variants: Loading state — spinner visible, interaction locked
- [ ] All variants: Error state — color-semantic-error token applied to [element]
- [ ] Keyboard: Tab reaches component, Enter activates it
- [ ] Touch target: computed size ≥ 44×44px
- [ ] Color contrast: all variant × state combinations pass WCAG 2.2 AA
- [ ] [Component-specific criteria]

